Licences
========

This image contains software under several licences. This directory holds the licence
and notice files of each component, in one directory per component.

- triton-*: Triton Inference Server and its backends, BSD-3-Clause. Built from source.
- triton-linked-libraries: the libraries that Triton links statically, such as gRPC,
  abseil, protobuf, re2, curl, libevent, libevhtp, prometheus-cpp and nlohmann_json,
  with their NOTICE files.
- boost: the Boost headers that Triton is built with.
- onnxruntime, rocpydecode, migraphx, rocjpeg, miopen, rocblas, hipblaslt, hip-runtime:
  the ROCm image only.
- tensorrt, cuda-runtime: the CUDA image only, under NVIDIA's licences for the
  redistributable runtime libraries.

Every apt package also keeps its licence at /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright, and the
ROCm packages at /opt/rocm/share/doc/<package>/. Every Python package keeps its licence
in its dist-info directory under /usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages.
